So far, the 1h routing code does what it says for alt strategies because `_apply_direction_override` receives `_updown_tf`. I found one important caveat already: BTC passes `tf=None`, so `apply_windows: ['1h']` does not restrict BTC override by window. I’m checking whether that affects this restart scope or only alt macro lanes.
