The raw grep over data was too noisy, but it showed the key limitation: settled ghosts carry `side_source`/RSI and tape_map is separate; the new veto decision itself is not backfilled in ghost rows. I’m doing one structured parse now to quantify what can and cannot be validated from existing logs.
